Description: Tools for the joint analysis of multiple transcriptomics datasets
    using a network-based integration approach. The package provides an
    S4 object model based on MultiAssayExperiment for reproducible analysis of
    single-layer and multi-layer studies. It includes workflows for clustering,
    module visualization, functional annotation, upstream inference, and
    longitudinal follow-up while retaining compatibility helpers for legacy
    hCoCena objects.
